			"notes": "### English\n- Added Sturt's desert pea.\n- Updated textures for Chinese milk vetches, creepansies, crimson clovers, forget-me-nots, pansies, red spider lily, and sea holly.\n- Snapdragons are now generated in birch forest.\n- Dayflowers are no longer generated in birch forest.\n- Tweaked generation of jade vine.\n- Added loot to chest in desert pyramid.\n- Added compatibility for market of Farming for Blockheads. (requires enabling in Farming for Blockheads config)\n- Added recipes for Manual Labour.\n- Readded recipes for Cyclic.\n- Updated recipes for Create, Create: Mechanical Botany, Farmer's Delight, Immersive Engineering, and Oritech.\n- Added block data maps for `jafohana:creeper_explosion_convertibles` and `jafohana:mutable_flowers`.\n- Added block tags for `jafohana:desert_flower_plantable_on` and `jafohana:vine_flower_replaceable_world_gen`.\n- Renamed `jafohana:affects_fasciations` block tag to `jafohana:withered_blocks`.\n- Renamed `jafohana:convertable_to_fasciated_dandelion` block tag to `jafohana:can_convert_to_fasciated_dandelion`.\n- Renamed `jafohana:convertable_to_fasciated_oxeye_daisy` block tag to `jafohana:can_convert_to_fasciated_oxeye_daisy`.\n- Removed block tag for `jafohana:convertable_to_creepansy`.\n- Removed entity type tag for `jafohana:can_convert_to_creepansy`.\n- Removed config entries for `dandelionFasciationChance`, `oxeyeDaisyFasciationChance`, and `creepansyConvertChance`.\n- Tweaked some biome tags, biome modifiers and worldgen features.\n- Added and updated more compatibility with some mods.\n- Some minor changes and fixes.\n### Japanese\n- スターツ・デザート・ピーを追加。\n- 蓮華草、クリーパンジー、ベニバナツメクサ、勿忘草、パンジー、彼岸花、シーホーリーのテクスチャを更新。\n- シラカバの森で金魚草が生成されるようになった。\n- シラカバの森でツユクサが生成されなくなった。\n- ヒスイカズラの生成を調整。\n- 砂漠の寺院のチェストに戦利品を追加。\n- Farming for Blockheadsの市場との互換性を追加。(Farming for Blockheadsのコンフィグで有効化する必要があります)\n- Manual Labourとのレシピ互換性を追加。\n- Cyclicとのレシピ互換性を再び追加。\n- Create、Create: Mechanical Botany、Farmer's Delight、Immersive Engineering、Oritechとのレシピ互換性を更新。\n- `jafohana:creeper_explosion_convertibles`、`jafohana:mutable_flowers`のブロックのデータマップを追加。\n- `jafohana:desert_flower_plantable_on`、`jafohana:vine_flower_replaceable_world_gen`ブロックタグを追加。\n- `jafohana:affects_fasciations`ブロックタグを`jafohana:withered_blocks`にリネーム。\n- `jafohana:convertable_to_fasciated_dandelion`ブロックタグを`jafohana:can_convert_to_fasciated_dandelion`にリネーム。\n- `jafohana:convertable_to_fasciated_oxeye_daisy`ブロックタグを`jafohana:can_convert_to_fasciated_oxeye_daisy`にリネーム。\n- `jafohana:convertable_to_creepansy`ブロックタグを削除。\n- `jafohana:can_convert_to_creepansy`エンティティタイプタグを削除。\n- `dandelionFasciationChance`、`oxeyeDaisyFasciationChance`、`creepansyConvertChance`のコンフィグ項目を削除。\n- いくつかのバイオームタグとBiome Modifier、生成物の調整。\n- いくつかのMODの互換性を追加、更新。\n- いくつかの細かな変更、修正。"
		},
